{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022b.q37.material.recovered", "text": "某中学八年级（3）班体育课，内容是学习单手肩上投篮，男、女各16人，女生运动技能水平较低，男生相对较高。教师将学生分成四排，队形组织见图1，教师先介绍本次课的教学内容，然后结合动作要领在罚球线上进行投篮动作示范，男、女生分组进行两人一球面对面投篮模仿练习，练习队形和教师巡回指导的区域见图2。 图一：学生成四排观察单手肩上投篮完整动作示范图二：学生练习的队形与教师巡回指导", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "609faa9a2e1709d9046f9af93a967182d76e79299651fb390bf0f3936145dcaf", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3280, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3466, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 37, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "609faa9a2e1709d9046f9af93a967182d76e79299651fb390bf0f3936145dcaf"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022b.q37"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k06", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r004", "ntce.outline.313.r007", "ntce.outline.313.r016", "ntce.outline.313.r017", "ntce.outline.313.r018", "ntce.outline.313.r020", "ntce.outline.313.r028"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2022b.q37"], "word_count": 186, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "609faa9a2e1709d9046f9af93a967182d76e79299651fb390bf0f3936145dcaf", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3280, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3466, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资